WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.420
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
How much do you really know about

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.167
the elusive Natasha Romanoff?

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.944
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Before I worked for S.H.I.E.L.D.,

00:00:05.944 --> 00:00:07.198
I made a name for myself.

00:00:07.198 --> 00:00:09.071
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
When it was time to assemble the Avengers,

00:00:09.071 --> 00:00:10.111
who did S.H.I.E.L.D. call?

00:00:10.111 --> 00:00:11.303
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Let me put you on hold.

00:00:13.284 --> 00:00:14.688
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
A former KGB assassin,

00:00:14.688 --> 00:00:16.458
agent of
S.H.I.E.L.D, and Avenger,

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:18.752
she fought through
the Battle of New York...

00:00:18.776 --> 00:00:20.823
...squared off
against the Winter Soldier...

00:00:20.823 --> 00:00:22.958
...defended
the world against Ultron.

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:24.815
She signed
the Sokovia Accords...

00:00:24.815 --> 00:00:26.110
...dealt with all that fallout.

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:29.038
And beat back
the forces of Thanos.

00:00:32.735 --> 00:00:35.631
And when all seemed lost,
she held the team together.

00:00:35.631 --> 00:00:38.801
But... How well do you really
know her? It's time for her story.

00:00:39.465 --> 00:00:41.083
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I've lived a lot of lives.

00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:49.508
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
You've been waiting for this.

